	XLIST	0	/LIST TASK CODE
/
/
/
/	 CCCC  L       OOO    CCCC  K   K
/	C      L      O   O  C      K  K
/	C      L      O   O  C      K K
/	C      L      O   O  C      KK
/	C      L      O   O  C      K K
/	C      L      O   O  C      K  K
/	 CCCC  LLLLL   OOO    CCCC  K   K
